I am standing in the shop and looking for a jacket for the summer.
The shop is large and very bright.
There are many different jackets here.
I look at a rack with light jackets.
I find two jackets particularly beautiful.
I take a blue jacket and a green jacket from the rack.
Now I compare both jackets.
The blue jacket looks sporty.
But the fabric is a bit thick.
The green jacket is much lighter than the blue jacket.
I hold them next to each other.
The green jacket is also a bit longer than the blue one.
I like that much better.
The green colour is also more beautiful than the blue colour.
This jacket is simply perfect for the warm weather.
I drape the green jacket over my arm.
Now I only need a new T-shirt.
